        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-20T16:42:21Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(mcp): compact read modes and chat context budgets\n\nget_job takes summary (no machine definition, only changed operation\nfields). list_operation_types filters by kind or section. list_features\ntakes compact (short rows, default limit 25). provider::tools_in offers a\ncore set of 25 tools; the chat sends it to local endpoints.\n\nThe chat worker cuts each tool reply at 12000 JSON characters with a\nhint, sends one viewport image per request, stops a turn after 12\nrounds, and keeps 6 earlier turns plus the latest get_job reply when it\ndrops older ones.\n\nFixes #1944\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
